1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
 If you're looking to lose all your gains,

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:04,420
 here are the three worst ways to work out,

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,360
 according to science.

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,600
 First, the bro split.

5
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:08,920
 This split trains each muscle group once per week,

6
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:11,340
 chest day, back day, arm day, and so on.

7
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,200
 But research shows that muscles grow best

8
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,920
 when they're trained two to three times a week.

9
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,860
 The bro split means wasted gains.

10
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,300
 Second, endless cardio.

11
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,220
 Logging hours and hours on the treadmill

12
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:22,160
 is the least efficient way to lose fat.

13
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,840
 It wears down your joints and slows your muscle recovery.

14
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,760
 Worst of all, it's so boring,

15
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,220
 you'll dread going to the gym.

16
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,180
 Third, freestyle workouts.

17
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,880
 Walking in without a plan means random exercises

18
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,280
 and missing muscle groups.

19
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,460
 No plan means no progress.

20
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:39,220
 If you want a workout routine that maximizes your gains,

21
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,800
 just comment the word gym and I'll reach out.

